{
  "surface": "linksnap",
  "route": "/linksnap",
  "notes": "The page at rest, signed out: the title, and the shortener card with its field label, the empty field, the guest sentence and the one button. `origin` is the title because the page's frame and the app's frame are different heights and the design is the gaps between these boxes, not where the first one lands. `capture` is the card because it is the region both clients draw identically; the shadow the card casts is outside its own box and is covered by the raster. The radii of the field and the button are left out deliberately: the site draws both with Tailwind's `rounded-full`, which computes to `calc(infinity * 1px)`, and a number that is not a length cannot be compared - the raster is what proves the pill. `signed-in` is the same route with a session behind it: the custom-code field and its hint, and the password field, which the guest form does not draw. The success block after a short is a state of its own and is not part of this contract yet. The signed-in state's 1.2px length tolerance is Compose's per-box pixel snapping at DPR 2.75: the 50- and 46-high fields and their half-pixel gaps each round to a whole device pixel, which accumulates 1.09px on the 380-high card.",
  "states": [
    {
      "name": "at-rest",
      "origin": "title",
      "capture": "card",
      "elements": [
        {
          "name": "title",
          "web": {
            "selector": "[data-visual='title'] h1"
          },
          "app": {
            "tag": "linksnap-title"
          },
          "properties": ["top", "height", "fontSize", "fontWeight"]
        },
        {
          "name": "card",
          "web": {
            "selector": "[data-visual='card']"
          },
          "app": {
            "tag": "linksnap-card"
          },
          "properties": ["top", "width", "height", "radius", "paddingTop", "paddingLeft"]
        },
        {
          "name": "label",
          "web": {
            "selector": "[data-visual='label']"
          },
          "app": {
            "tag": "linksnap-label"
          },
          "properties": ["top", "height", "fontSize", "fontWeight"]
        },
        {
          "name": "input",
